  "content": "\n\n<h2>Create 列車燈光</h2>\n<p>也請查看我的其他模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-trainutilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 列車工具</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-seats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 更多座位</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dab894f613724987b6fde69b92ed96344a199abc_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>此 Create 擴充模組為列車新增了自訂的內部照明與頭尾燈，並會根據行進方向自動切換頭燈與尾燈。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DkcprwueFj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/1248636479627071488/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2>相依模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h3>總覽影片</h3>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe height=\"300\" width=\"550px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xErJQp5fpWs?si=GN6k2pMxVDsjeVrt\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3>頭燈／尾燈</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d4c9e507041466663f9c1ce8675fbe90d65cfb2f_0.webp\" alt=\"img_one\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b6f360c0f4a63f97f4e05d53d1c8c7a369a8c61_0.webp\" alt=\"img_two\"></div>\n<p>……還有更多！</p>\n<h3>內部照明</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/50c38a6ede9244d0db7f389b669631e8aac9476b_0.webp\" alt=\"img_one\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5135e7171a59d39a1fd66010bbbea4ef4f60a1f5_0.webp\" alt=\"img_two\"></div>\n<p>……還有更多！</p>\n<h3>其他功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>可手動關閉</li>\n<li>頭燈與尾燈顏色會依行進方向自動切換</li>\n<li>支援透過右鍵點擊與組件控制介面來操控載具燈光。</li>\n<li>以及更多！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>語言支援</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>英文</li>\n<li>西班牙文（由 Albertosaurio 提供）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>重要提醒！</h2>\n<p>安裝模組更新前，請務必先備份您的世界檔案，以確保世界資料安全。</p>\n<h2>支持我</h2>\n<p>如果您想支持我和我的開發工作，歡迎前往我的 Ko-fi 頁面 ❤️</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fadeptstack_programmerlp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a></li>\n</ul>",
